VAULT_PATHS=/Users/username/Obsidian/MyVault
# Multiple vaults: comma-separate them. The first one is active by default;
# switching in the dashboard persists the choice to SYMPOSE_SETTINGS_PATH.
# VAULT_PATHS=/Users/username/Obsidian/MyVault,/Users/username/Obsidian/Work

# SYMPOSE_PROFILES_DIR defaults to ./profiles — one directory per persona
# (profiles/<handle>/persona.yaml, plus that persona's soul, memory, sessions)
# SYMPOSE_SETTINGS_PATH defaults to ./settings.json

# The chat engine defaults to a local Ollama model (ollama_chat/gemma2:9b) —
# make sure Ollama is running and that model is pulled. litellm reads
# OLLAMA_API_BASE for a non-default Ollama host (default http://localhost:11434).
# OLLAMA_API_BASE=http://localhost:11434

# Slack (docs/decisions/093): `sympose slack` makes each persona that has a token pair its own Slack user.
# Make one Slack App per persona (`sympose slack manifest <handle>` prints its settings to paste into Slack), then give the pair for each; the owner is your own Slack user ID. Steps: docs/SLACK_SETUP.md.
# SLACK_OWNER_USER_ID=U0123456789
# SLACK_SAMANTHA_BOT_TOKEN=xoxb-...
# SLACK_SAMANTHA_APP_TOKEN=xapp-...
